# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# sw.js, index.html and config.js must NOT be edge-cached: the service worker's
# entire update path depends on the browser re-fetching sw.js and finding a new
# BUILD_ID, and config.js is regenerated per deploy with the API origin in it.
#
# TWO immutable rules, because the deploy artifact lands in two places.
# scripts/bgb-bundle.mjs writes bgb-app.<hash>.js and bgb-<hash>.css to the site
# ROOT, not into assets/ (see the comment at the top of that file: Vercel's
# zero-config detection treats build/ and dist/ as output directories, so the
# root was the safe choice). An /assets/* rule alone therefore misses the two
# largest files on the site — ~274 KB of JS and ~294 KB of CSS revalidating on
# every navigation. vercel.json used to carry that rule; this is where it lives
# now that Pages is the host.
#
# Safe to pin for a year in both cases for the same reason: the name contains a
# hash of the contents, so a changed file is a different URL. Nothing else at
# the root is named bgb-*.

# NO Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy HERE, DELIBERATELY. Google sign-in runs
# signInWithPopup against auth.bgbuddy.app (domain/auth.js explains why popup
# and not redirect), and the credential comes back over postMessage from that
# popup. COOP: same-origin severs the opener relationship that carries it, so
# adding one in a hardening pass would break sign-in on every browser.
# Chrome logs "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy policy would block the window.close
# call" during that flow regardless: it comes from Firebase's own auth handler
# closing its window, on an origin whose headers are Firebase Hosting's to
# send. It is a console warning, not a failure — the popup closes and the
# sign-in completes.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/config.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/bgb-*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
